The code also ensures proper shutdown of the site in case of errors or external termination and handles potential delays due to external dependencies such as database connectivity or network services by retrying failed connections up to a certain number of attempts before returning an error. The function is designed to operate efficiently under high concurrency loads, minimizing contention and maximizing throughput.

