lte_phy_rx_stats_init(&ctx, <some_initial_size>);
```

Add new records to the array using the `lte_phy_rx_stats_add()` function. You can also reset the average calculation with `lte_phy_rx_stats_reset_avg()`. To export the collected statistics to a file, call `lte_phy_rx_stats_export()`.

Please note that this code does not include error handling for file I/O operations such as closing the output file or dealing with multiple concurrent exports. You may want to handle these cases according to your specific use-case requirements and system constraints.']

