The dynamic_list_add function allows appending new elements to the list, while dynamic_list_remove removes an element at the specified index. The dynamic_list_of_crcs function creates a dynamic list given a size parameter and returns a struct containing a pointer to the list and its size. The code also includes memory allocation error handling and pthread_mutex_destroy in case of memory leaks or errors during freeing resources.']

