To handle concurrent access from multiple threads, the `nimManagerThreadFunction` should implement your specific updates based on network conditions. Lastly, the number of threads can be set with the `nimManagerStartThreads` function. You'll need to evaluate the performance implications of different thread synchronization mechanisms and choose the most appropriate one for your use case.']

