Please note that the random value initialization logic is not implemented, and you should replace it with the desired method for generating random values within the specified range. Additionally, the logging system is just a placeholder, so you'll need to integrate your existing logging system instead. Furthermore, this code does not ensure scalability beyond millions of entries or handle edge cases such as memory exhaustion or cache overflow.

