The memory allocation is optimized by dynamically allocating and reusing cells within a fixed array (capacity 1024), ensuring that the memory consumption scales efficiently.

Note: Ensure to properly handle the empty list case when popping elements, and ensure the thread safety of other functions that may interact with this structure. Additionally, include necessary validation logic for RNTI values based on the current UE configuration.']

