For future feature enhancements or modifications to the structure definition, you can simply modify the `LTE_PHY_RX_CQI_MEASUREMENT` struct without affecting the rest of the code. The current implementation does not handle edge cases such as invalid inputs or unexpected data from the external source; those should be addressed in a more robust production-ready codebase.']

